          "id": 794984705,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@johnthacker added a cast for the first issue, but letting `ws_strtou8()` to do all the relevant error checks is a good idea, so I picked up your change in !5567 (and fixed the problem that caused the test failures - `p` rather than `ws_optval` was being passed to `ws_strtou8()`, and `p` didn't point to anywhere valid).\n\nIt looks as if @johnthacker also checked in the second change in !5565.",
